1
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:13,360
Orders lists every pending order: entry orders waiting for their price, and orders waiting for your confirmation.

2
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:18,520
Proximity is the distance to the market in pips, and it updates live. T is the order type: EL entry limit, ES entry stop.

3
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:26,780
Execute and Reject decide the orders that wait for you. The badge on the tab counts all pending orders.

4
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:34,390
Right-click a column header to choose the columns. Here, Predef.Stop.

5
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:39,550
Right-click an order to change it.

6
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:45,530
Modify Order changes its rate or size.

7
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:54,810
The new rate is in the list.

8
00:00:54,910 --> 00:01:03,290
Stop and Limit attach a stop-loss or take-profit to the entry order. It applies once the order fills; the entry rate is unchanged.

9
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:10,290
Predef.Stop shows it.

10
00:01:10,390 --> 00:01:16,770
Remove Order cancels it for the client.

11
00:01:16,870 --> 00:01:19,770
The order leaves the list.

